<witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-03-09T00:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-03-09T00:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Closed SV. Pressure tested XMT flowcross (PVW/HMV/SV) to 30/200 bar 5/10 min - ok. Bled off pressure to closed drain and closed KWV.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-03-09T00:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-03-09T00:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Held toolbox talk for rigging up WL.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-03-09T00:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-03-09T02:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Lifted up WL lubricator and upper sheave. Rigged up lower sheave. Connected cable head to WL tractor and pulled same into lubricator. Built PLT toolstring using tugger. Stabbed PLT toolstring into WL riser and connected to WL tractor.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-03-09T02:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-03-09T03:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml